"This FID's master is already %@ on the chain. FEIP6 makes a master permanent, so another master carve would be paid for and ignored" = "此 FID 的主人在链上已是 %@。FEIP6 规定主人一经设定永不更改，再次上链设置主人只会白付交易费并被忽略";
"The chain already has this DOCK and DISK, so there is nothing to carve" = "链上已有相同的 DOCK 和 DISK，无需上链";
"%@ has never published a pubkey, so there is nothing to encrypt a Cmail to. They need to spend from that FID at least once." = "%@ 从未公开过公钥，无法向其加密密信。对方需要至少用该 FID 花费一次。";
