"the Cmail could not be prepared for sending" = "无法准备要发送的密信";
"%@ is the identity you are living as — a FID cannot rate itself." = "%@ 是你当前使用的身份——FID 不能评价自己。";
"%@ has no on-chain record yet, and FEIP16 only applies a rating to a FID that has one. The rating would cost the fee and change nothing." = "%@ 尚无链上记录，而 FEIP16 只对已有记录的 FID 生效。这次评价只会白付交易费，不会有任何改变。";
"A rating has to destroy at least 1 CoinDay to be counted; %@ is below that." = "评价至少要销毁 1 币天才会被计入；%@ 低于此值。";
"No %@ was given to rate. A rating names its subject in the payload, and a carve naming an empty one confirms and changes nothing." = "未指定要评价的%@。评价需在载荷中写明对象，对象为空的上链记录即使确认也不会有任何改变。";
"You are the %@ of this %@, and the protocol ignores a rating from its own %@. The carve would cost the fee and the CoinDays and change nothing." = "你是此%2$@的%1$@，协议会忽略来自其%3$@的评价。上链只会白付交易费和币天，不会有任何改变。";

