"Users of an app signed with an older keystore cannot update to a build signed with this one unless the build carries a v3 rotation proof: apksigner rotate --old-signer --ks <old> --new-signer --ks <this .p12>." = "用旧密钥库签名的应用，其用户无法更新到用此密钥库签名的版本，除非该版本带有 v3 轮换证明：apksigner rotate --old-signer --ks <old> --new-signer --ks <this .p12>。";
