"Leave this team?" = "离开此团队？";
"Leave the team" = "离开团队";
"Leaving is a transaction and it is public. The transcript stays on this Mac, but you stop receiving anything new, and rejoining needs a fresh invitation from the owner." = "离开是一笔公开的交易。聊天记录保留在这台 Mac 上，但你不会再收到新内容，重新加入需要所有者再次邀请。";
"put off" = "已暂缓";
"This team" = "此团队";
"New consensus" = "新共识";
"The new consensus" = "新共识";
"The team names no consensus document." = "此团队未指定共识文档。";
"What you agreed to" = "你同意过的内容";
"The consensus you signed" = "你签署过的共识";
"This Mac never saw this team's previous consensus, so there is nothing to compare against. The owner can tell you what changed." = "这台 Mac 从未见过此团队之前的共识，因此没有可比较的内容。所有者可以告诉你改动了什么。";
"Agreeing is a transaction: it costs a miner fee and is public. It quotes the team's consensus id as it stands the moment you sign, so if the owner has changed it again since, that is what gets signed." = "同意是一笔交易：需要矿工费，并且是公开的。它引用的是你签名那一刻团队的共识 ID，所以如果所有者此后又修改过，签署的就是修改后的那份。";
"Agree" = "同意";
"Carving…" = "上链中…";
"Not now" = "暂不";
"Keeps it here and stops it prompting. It comes back if the owner changes the consensus again." = "保留在这里并不再提示。如果所有者再次更改共识，它会重新出现。";
"Read…" = "阅读…";
"Broadcast — tx %@. This clears itself from here on the next refresh, once the chain stops listing you." = "已广播——交易 %@。链上不再列出你之后，下次刷新时此项会自行消失。";
"Put off. It stays here and stops prompting; if the owner changes the consensus again it comes back." = "已暂缓。它会保留在这里并不再提示；如果所有者再次更改共识，它会重新出现。";
"Leaving — tx %@. The thread stays on this Mac and stops receiving once the carve confirms." = "正在离开——交易 %@。会话保留在这台 Mac 上，上链确认后不再接收消息。";

