/* ---- Views/Panes/Chat/GroupSettingsSheet.swift ---- */
"Square settings" = "广场设置";
"Team settings" = "团队设置";
"Square name" = "广场名称";
"Team name" = "团队名称";
"required" = "必填";
"optional" = "可选";
"Where this %@'s messages rest until each member collects them. Emptying this box does not remove the %@'s DOCK — the update op can move it, but has no way to say it has none." = "此%1$@的消息在各成员取走之前的存放处。清空此框并不会移除该%2$@的 DOCK——更新操作可以迁移它，但无法表示“没有”。";
"service id, or host:port" = "服务 ID，或 host:port";
"Search the chain for a server that offers DOCK." = "在链上搜索提供 DOCK 的服务器。";
"Where the consensus document is stored, published in plain text so any member — or anyone weighing up joining — can fetch it without being sent anything. Move it and the current document is copied across first, because members who have not re-signed still need to read what they agreed to." = "共识文档的存放处，以明文公布，任何成员——或任何正在考虑加入的人——无需别人发送即可获取。迁移时会先把当前文档复制过去，因为尚未重新签署的成员仍需要阅读他们同意过的内容。";
"service id" = "服务ID";
"Search the chain for a server that offers DISK." = "在链上搜索提供 DISK 的服务器。";
"The relay this team's meetings run on, paid by whoever starts one. Empty: no meetings, and emptying a set one removes it." = "此团队会议所用的中继，由发起会议的人付费。留空：不能开会；清空已设置的值会将其移除。";
"service id, or fudp://host:port" = "服务 ID，或 fudp://host:port";
"Search the chain for a server that offers CALL." = "在链上搜索提供 CALL 的服务器。";
"Save on-chain" = "保存上链";
"Choose this %@'s DOCK" = "选择此%@的 DOCK";
"Every member re-resolves this id through the chain, so a server that moves does not take the %@ with it." = "每位成员都会通过链重新解析此 ID，因此服务器迁移不会带走%@。";
"Choose this team's DISK" = "选择此团队的 DISK";
"The consensus document is stored here, unencrypted and permanently, and its id is published so anyone can check the bytes hash back to what was carved." = "共识文档未加密并永久存放在这里，其 ID 公开发布，任何人都能核对这些字节的哈希是否与上链内容一致。";
"Choose this team's CALL service" = "选择此团队的 CALL 服务";
"Every member will have to agree to this again" = "每位成员都需要重新同意";
"Carve the new consensus" = "上链新共识";
"Consensus document" = "共识文档";
"What members agree to when they join. Its id is the hash of the text, so a different document is always a different id. Carving a new one does not re-ask anybody: existing members keep the agreement they signed, and the chain lists them as not having agreed to the new one until each carves their own agreement." = "成员加入时同意的内容。它的 ID 是文本的哈希，因此不同的文档必然有不同的 ID。上链新文档不会重新询问任何人：现有成员保留他们签署过的同意，链上会把他们列为尚未同意新共识，直到各自上链自己的同意。";
"This team's consensus" = "此团队的共识";
"View…" = "查看…";
"Read the document this id names — from this Mac if it is here, otherwise from the team's DISK or the one in the box above." = "阅读此 ID 指向的文档——如果在这台 Mac 上就从本地读取，否则从团队的 DISK 或上面框中的 DISK 读取。";
"Write a new consensus" = "撰写新共识";
"Write…" = "撰写…";
"Edit the text. Saving stores a new document on this Mac and puts its id here; nothing is published until you carve." = "编辑文本。保存时会在这台 Mac 上存储一份新文档并把其 ID 填到这里；上链之前不会发布任何内容。";
"Choose file…" = "选择文件…";
"Use a file from this Mac as the consensus. It is registered where it lies and hashed to get its id." = "使用这台 Mac 上的文件作为共识。它会在原位置登记，并通过哈希得到 ID。";
"A new document, held on this Mac. Saving uploads it to the team's DISK first — a consensus nobody can fetch is a promise nobody can check." = "一份保存在这台 Mac 上的新文档。保存时会先把它上传到团队的 DISK——谁也取不到的共识，就是谁也无法核对的承诺。";
"This id does not match anything on this Mac. Saving will look for it on the team's DISK, and refuse rather than carve an id with nothing behind it." = "此 ID 与这台 Mac 上的任何内容都不匹配。保存时会在团队的 DISK 上查找，找不到则拒绝上链，以免上链一个没有内容支撑的 ID。";
"This is a watch-only identity, so there is no prikey here to sign a carve with." = "这是仅观察身份，这里没有可为上链签名的私钥。";
"This Mac has no owner on file for this team, so it cannot tell whether the chain will accept an update from you." = "这台 Mac 上没有此团队的所有者记录，因此无法判断链是否会接受你的更新。";
"You do not own this team. The chain accepts an update only from its owner, so this carve would cost a fee and change nothing." = "你不是此团队的所有者。链只接受所有者的更新，因此这次上链只会白付交易费，不会有任何改变。";
"Carving a different consensus id replaces what this team runs on. You are its only member, so there is nobody to re-sign." = "上链不同的共识 ID 会替换此团队所遵循的共识。你是唯一的成员，因此无需他人重新签署。";
"Carving a different consensus id puts all %@ other member(s) on the chain's list of people who have not agreed to it, until each of them carves an agreement of their own — a transaction each, which they pay for. Until they do, what they signed and what the team runs on are two different documents. They can also leave instead." = "上链不同的共识 ID 会把其他全部 %@ 位成员列入链上“尚未同意”的名单，直到他们各自上链自己的同意——每人一笔交易，费用自付。在此之前，他们签署的和团队实际遵循的是两份不同的文档。他们也可以选择离开。";
"Saving is a transaction: it costs a miner fee and is public. Nothing changes here until the carve confirms and you refresh." = "保存是一笔交易：需要矿工费，并且是公开的。上链确认并刷新之前，这里不会有任何变化。";
"Anyone in a square may change it — what decides it is coin-days, not permission. The last change destroyed %@ CD, so this one has to destroy more than that, and whatever you destroy becomes the price of the next change. CD is value that has sat still: an old coin carries more of it than a large one." = "广场中的任何人都可以更改它——起决定作用的是币天，而不是权限。上一次更改销毁了 %@ 币天，所以这一次必须销毁更多，而你销毁的数量将成为下一次更改的门槛。币天是静置不动的价值：一枚存放久的币比一枚大额的币带有更多币天。";
"Anyone in a square may change it — what decides it is coin-days, not permission. Nobody has changed this one yet, so it costs what any carve costs: a miner fee and 1 CD. Whatever this destroys becomes the price of the next change." = "广场中的任何人都可以更改它——起决定作用的是币天，而不是权限。它还没有被人更改过，所以费用与任何上链相同：矿工费加 1 币天。这次销毁的数量将成为下一次更改的门槛。";
"%@ Nothing changes here until the carve confirms and you refresh." = "%@ 上链确认并刷新之前，这里不会有任何变化。";
"This team is not on this Mac. Refresh the Teams tab and try again." = "此团队不在这台 Mac 上。请刷新“团队”标签页后重试。";
"This square is not on this Mac. Refresh the Squares tab and try again." = "此广场不在这台 Mac 上。请刷新“广场”标签页后重试。";
"Only a team or a square is changed this way." = "只有团队或广场可以这样更改。";
"Choose the document this team's members agree to." = "选择此团队成员所同意的文档。";
"Broadcast — tx %@. The %@'s new details appear here once the carve confirms and you refresh." = "已广播——交易 %@。上链确认并刷新后，%@的新信息会显示在这里。";
"Every other member is now asked to agree to the new consensus before the chain counts them as having done so." = "现在其他每位成员都会被要求同意新共识，之后链上才会把他们计为已同意。";
"Checking the team's DISK for the document…" = "正在团队的 DISK 上查找文档…";
"The current consensus document could not be copied to the new DISK. It stays readable on the old one until that server drops it." = "无法把当前共识文档复制到新的 DISK。在旧服务器删除它之前，仍可从旧服务器读取。";
"A new consensus needs a DISK to live on: the id carved on chain is only a hash, and without a server publishing the bytes no member can read what they are agreeing to. Set this team's DISK and save again." = "新共识需要有 DISK 来存放：上链的 ID 只是哈希，没有服务器公布这些字节，成员就无法阅读他们要同意的内容。请设置此团队的 DISK 后重新保存。";
"That consensus id names no document this Mac can find — not on the team's DISK, not here, and not on the DISK the team is moving from. Nothing was carved. Write the document or choose its file, and the id will follow from its contents." = "这台 Mac 找不到该共识 ID 所指的文档——团队的 DISK 上没有，本地没有，团队正在迁出的 DISK 上也没有。没有上链任何内容。请撰写文档或选择其文件，ID 会由内容自动得出。";

