/* ---- Views/Panes/FirstFchBoardView.swift ---- */
"Send %@ F to %lld newcomer%@?" = "向 %2$lld 位新人发送 %1$@ F？";
"%lld output%@ of %@ F, paid from %@ in one transaction.\n\nThey are strangers, and the board says nothing about them beyond what they typed. This broadcasts immediately and cannot be undone." = "%1$lld 个输出，每个 %3$@ F，由 %4$@ 在一笔交易中支付。\n\n他们是陌生人，求助板上除了他们自己输入的内容之外没有任何信息。此操作会立即广播，无法撤销。";
"Check at login" = "登录时检查";
"Off by default. When on, Freer looks once per login for newcomers asking for their first FCH, and tells you only if somebody is waiting." = "默认关闭。开启后，Freer 每次登录时会查看一次是否有新人在请求第一笔 FCH，只有在有人等待时才提醒你。";
"Nothing works until somebody sends you a coin." = "在有人给你发币之前，什么都做不了。";
"A beginner can do nothing until somebody gives them a coin." = "在有人给新人发币之前，他们什么都做不了。";
"Every action on chain costs a fee, so a brand-new FID can do nothing at all — not buy a name, not send a message, not record anything — until somebody who already has coins sends it a few. The people below are in exactly that position and have said so. Tick the ones you want to help, choose an amount, and one transaction pays them all.\n\nAnyone can write on this board, as often as they like, and a row is only a FID and a sentence somebody typed — none of it is checked. Click a FID to see how old it is and what others have said about it on chain, and send only what you are content to give away." = "链上的每个操作都需要交易费，所以一个全新的 FID 什么都做不了——不能买名称、不能发消息、不能记录任何内容——直到有币的人给它发来一些。下面这些人正处于这种境地，并已发出请求。勾选你想帮助的人，选择金额，一笔交易即可全部付清。\n\n任何人都可以在这块求助板上发帖，次数不限，每一行只是一个 FID 和某人输入的一句话——都未经核实。点击 FID 可查看它的存在时间以及别人在链上对它的评价，只发送你乐意赠出的金额。";
"Every action on chain costs a fee, and this FID has none, so there is nothing it can do yet. Post below and any freer who opens this page can send you enough to start.\n\nYou never need to pay, click a link, or share anything to receive coins. The only sign that somebody helped is your own balance going up." = "链上的每个操作都需要交易费，而此 FID 没有任何余额，因此目前什么都做不了。在下面发帖后，任何打开此页面的飞人都可以给你发来足以起步的币。\n\n接收币从不需要你付款、点击链接或分享任何信息。有人帮助你的唯一标志，就是你自己的余额增加了。";
"Public board" = "公共求助板";
"Ask for your first FCH" = "首币求助";
"Your request is on the board. Now wait for somebody to see it and send coins to your address — and you can ask people you know to send to the same one. A FID asks once: posting again says nothing new." = "你的请求已在求助板上。现在请等待有人看到并向你的地址发币——你也可以请认识的人向同一地址发送。一个 FID 只需请求一次：重复发帖不会带来新信息。";
"Your address" = "你的地址";
"Your FID and your note go on the public board above, where anyone can read them. Nothing else about you is shared." = "你的 FID 和留言会出现在上面的公共求助板上，任何人都能看到。不会分享你的其他任何信息。";
