/* ---- Views/Panes/IdentitySettingsSection.swift ---- */
"Who you are on the chain. Each record is a carve with a small fee." = "你在链上的身份。每条记录都是一次上链，需要少量交易费。";
"Your CID is the name people find you by; the last characters of your FID are added to keep it unique, and registering one puts your pubkey on the chain. A master is optional and permanent: only set one to a FID of your own that you trust completely. Each is a carve with a small fee, and shows here once a block confirms it." = "CID 是别人用来找到你的名称；会附加你 FID 的末尾几个字符以保持唯一，注册 CID 还会把你的公钥放到链上。主人是可选的，且一经设定永不更改：请只设置为你自己拥有且完全信任的 FID。每一项都是一次上链，需要少量交易费，区块确认后会显示在这里。";
"Where you read the chain and where people reach you." = "你从哪里读取链上数据，以及别人到哪里联系你。";
"Your BASE is the server you read the chain through: once it is carved, every device of yours connects to it. Your DOCK holds messages while you're offline and your DISK keeps your files — until both are on the chain, nobody has anywhere to reach you. Each is a service id, so a server can move without anyone losing you. Carving your home costs a small fee, and shows here once a block confirms it." = "BASE 是你读取链上数据所经由的服务器：一旦上链，你的每台设备都会连接它。DOCK 在你离线时保存消息，DISK 保存你的文件——在两者都上链之前，别人无处联系你。每一项都是服务 ID，因此服务器迁移时不会有人找不到你。上链主页需要少量交易费，区块确认后会显示在这里。";
"Permanent" = "永久";
"Only the main FID can have a master." = "只有主身份可以设置主人。";
"None" = "无";
"the master" = "主人";
"The first master is the only one: the protocol ignores any later master carve." = "第一个主人就是唯一的主人：协议会忽略之后任何设置主人的上链。";
"Another FID of yours that can recover this one. Setting it puts your prikey on the chain, sealed to the master, for good." = "你的另一个可以恢复此身份的 FID。设置后，你的私钥会加密给主人并永久存放在链上。";

