"Who is this Cmail for?" = "这封密信发给谁？";
"Looking up %@…" = "正在查询 %@…";
"Couldn't reach the chain to price this Cmail." = "无法连接链以计算这封密信的费用。";
"Notice fee: %@ F" = "通知费：%@ F";
"This FID has never published a pubkey." = "此 FID 从未公开过公钥。";
"A Cmail is encrypted to the recipient's key, so there is nothing to encrypt to. A FID publishes its key the first time it spends — ask them to send any transaction, then try again." = "密信是加密给收件人密钥的，而现在没有可用于加密的密钥。FID 在第一次花费时公开其密钥——请让对方发送任意一笔交易，然后重试。";
