"This searched the %lld row%@ loaded here. Chain ▸ Search chain looks through the whole index." = "已在此处加载的 %1$lld 行中搜索。“链上 ▸ 搜索链上”会查找整个索引。";

/* ---- Views/Panes/ProtocolSheets.swift ---- */
