"From the document. Name, type, serial number, version, language, description and DID come from the .md file and are locked; to change them, edit the document and scan again." = "来自文档。名称、类型、序列号、版本、语言、描述和 DID 取自 .md 文件，已锁定；如需更改，请编辑文档后重新扫描。";
