"The whole registration rides in one transaction — %lld bytes for everything on this form." = "整个登记放在一笔交易中——此表单上的所有内容共 %lld 字节。";
"Document DID" = "文档 DID";
"digest of the specification document" = "规范文档的摘要值";
"The spec itself is not carved. This is its digest, so a reader who fetches the document can check it is the one that was registered." = "规范本身不会上链。这是它的摘要值，获取文档的读者可以据此核对是否就是所登记的那份。";
"Supersedes" = "取代";
"id of the protocol record this replaces" = "被它取代的协议记录的 ID";
"A published version is not editable in place: a new version is a new record that points back at the old one." = "已发布的版本不能原地修改：新版本是一条指回旧版本的新记录。";
"Where it lives" = "存放位置";
"Nobody — the owner is the only contact for this protocol." = "无——所有者是此协议的唯一联系人。";
