"Protocol ID" = "协议ID";
"This protocol has no on-chain id yet." = "此协议尚无链上 ID。";
"You own this protocol, and the protocol ignores a rating from its own owner." = "你是此协议的所有者，协议规则会忽略所有者自己的评价。";
