"The record stays on the chain and stays readable, flagged deleted — and Recover puts it back. What ends is its place in a listing. The body on DISK is not touched. One miner fee for the whole batch." = "记录仍留在链上且可读，标记为已删除——“恢复”可使其复原。结束的只是它在列表中的位置。DISK 上的正文不受影响。整批只需一次矿工费。";
