"no body" = "无正文";
"This record carries metadata only — its did is empty, so there is nothing to read." = "此记录只有元数据——其 did 为空，因此没有可阅读的内容。";
"You haven't published anything" = "你还没有发布过任何内容";
"Publishing a text catalogues it on the chain — a title, a summary, and a pointer to the work itself. The body is not carved: it goes to DISK, and what the chain holds is the hash of it, so anyone who fetches it can check they got the right bytes. The record's ID is the transaction that published it." = "发布文本会把它编目到链上——标题、摘要以及指向作品本身的指针。正文不会上链：它存入 DISK，链上保存的是其哈希，因此任何获取它的人都能核对是否拿到了正确的字节。记录的 ID 就是发布它的那笔交易。";
