"Stopping takes a service out of force without retiring it: the record stays on the chain, and Recover puts it back. It does not turn the server off — clients are told to stop routing here, and the daemon carries on answering until you stop it yourself. One miner fee for the whole batch." = "停止会让服务失效但不废弃：记录仍留在链上，“恢复”可使其重新生效。它不会关停服务器——只是告知客户端不要再路由到这里，守护进程在你自己停止之前会继续响应。整批只需一次矿工费。";
