"A service record registers a running instance: what it offers, where to reach it, who runs it and what it charges. It is the end of the chain the other Construct records start — a protocol is a specification, a code record is an implementation of one, and this is an implementation somebody is actually running at an address." = "服务记录登记的是一个正在运行的实例：它提供什么、在哪里访问、由谁运营以及如何收费。它是其他“构建”记录所开启的链条的终点——协议是规范，代码记录是规范的实现，而这是某人确实在某个地址上运行着的实现。";
